Author: Adrian Nyakundi

Title: Photography project

About:This project is a web-based application
 designed to showcase photography work. It features
  a clean layout with images.
  We basically take clients demands and always deliver 
  according to their needs.

  Project setup: the whole skeleton is basically in index.html and the 
  editing i did it via the style.css which i linked them with the code
  link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css" / 
  Then started with the header but instead of using a normal background I 
  inserted a picture to make it more appeling.background-image: url(yeah.avif);
  Then moved on to the navigation bar and placed links to My Story Sessions, 
  showcase, Team, contact us
  I the went ahead and inserted necessary information in the respective sections.
  for the images i just inserted them with the link img src="old lady.jpeg" alt="old"
  I also included a section where new clients could contact us and give us feedback.
  Then also placed the copywrite and ended with the team and their pictures.

